<title>HONG KONG: Paladin posts year net loss HK$20.86 mln.</title>
<headline>Paladin posts year net loss HK$20.86 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   4.82 loss  vs 3.39 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  1.21 loss  vs 22.09 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    20.86 loss vs 14.65 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     187.50     vs 49.79</p>
<p>    Company name		 Paladin Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  December 24-28</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE -Paladin is an investment holding and dealing company.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on provision for permanent diminution in value of investments and provision for doubtful debts.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
